@startuml
title Cache - Read Result and Operation Lifecycle
hide empty description
[*] --> LOOKUP
LOOKUP --> HIT : CacheValue.present
LOOKUP --> MISS_DOC : cache miss
LOOKUP --> DEGRADED : provider error + degrade policy
LOOKUP --> ERROR_DECLARED : CacheResultStatus.ERROR [declared API]
MISS_DOC --> RECHECK : mutexLoad=true
MISS_DOC --> LOAD_SOURCE : mutexLoad=false
RECHECK --> HIT : another caller filled cache
RECHECK --> LOAD_SOURCE : still miss
LOAD_SOURCE --> MISS_LOADED : loader returns and write attempted
LOAD_SOURCE --> THROWN_DOC : loader failure
HIT --> [*]
MISS_LOADED --> [*]
DEGRADED --> [*]
ERROR_DECLARED --> [*]
THROWN_DOC --> [*]

state "MISS [DOC MODEL]" as MISS_DOC
state "RECHECK [DOC MODEL]" as RECHECK
state "LOAD_SOURCE [DOC MODEL]" as LOAD_SOURCE
state "ERROR [CacheResultStatus declared]\ncurrent DefaultCacheClient does not construct it" as ERROR_DECLARED
state "EXCEPTION [DOC MODEL]" as THROWN_DOC

note right
HIT / MISS_LOADED / DEGRADED 是当前 DefaultCacheClient
实际返回的主要 CacheResultStatus。
EMPTY / ERROR 在枚举中存在，但当前主执行器没有对应静态工厂路径。
end note
@enduml
